surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Donaldson</surname><given-names>PT</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Associations between alleles of the major histocompatibility complex and type 1 autoimmune hepatitis</article-title><source>Hepatology</source><year>1997</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>317</fpage><lpage>323</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9021941</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/hep.510250211</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Autoantigens in primary biliary cirrhosis</article-title><source>J Clin Pathol</source><year>2000</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>813</fpage><lpage>821</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11127262</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/jcp.53.11.813</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>